        "substitution_conditions": "Any compatible load cell(s) may be used provided: a respective OIML R60 Certificate of Conformity exists containing the load cell type and necessary data for the manufacturer's declaration of compatibility of modules; the cell is not a load cell with digital output; characteristics (nlc, Y, Z) are the same or better than the tested load cell (Tedea Huntleigh 1042 C3, capacity 5 kg); design and material are the same; no oil damper is used; a cell marked NH is allowed only if humidity testing to R76 has been conducted."
